@crew vasquez-uma
// SW5, the endgame pool (plans/ending-spec.html section 9): said only after you choose to stay. Every line is
// gated by the bare condition "endgame" (EN2 adds it to the line filter, section 22); "endgame:early" marks the
// lines that only make sense in the first two weeks after you stay (RV21).

== chat
? endgame:early
- Hi hi. You stayed! The Chief says "a sound decision". With a pause. I've got it down.   #funny
? endgame:early
- I told Mum in my message. She said the orange fish did a flip. Fish know things.   #funny
? endgame
- Ordinary patrol. Doors, lockers, the long way round. It's nicer with company.
? endgame:early
- I wrote a little poem about the week. Nobody's reading it. It's about staying.   #warm
? endgame tier>=friend
- Home's a long way off. It's less far with people around who stay. Thank you.   #warm

== bye
? endgame
- "Know where your suit locker is." That's the Chief. Then a pause. Bye!   #funny
